sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant UI as React cart
    participant API as FastAPI checkout
    participant DB as Application database
    C->>UI: Select product, size and quantity
    UI->>API: Authenticated cart quote
    API->>DB: Read authoritative price and stock
    API-->>UI: Totals and review token
    C->>UI: Confirm simulated payment scenario
    UI->>API: Cart, shipping, token and idempotency key
    API->>DB: Serialize customer checkout and find existing result
    alt Existing matching key
        DB-->>API: Original result
    else New attempt
        API->>DB: Validate reviewed price, sizes and stock
        alt Simulated decline
            API->>DB: Store declined attempt and result
        else Simulated approval
            API->>DB: Reserve inventory and create owned order and payment
        end
        API->>DB: Commit transaction
    end
    API-->>UI: Simulated outcome and order when approved
    UI-->>C: Receipt or decline with retry guidance
